From 7c460427484df3ba515ad2cce19c5c3487a5a9bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tobias <ruck.tobias@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 1 May 2021 12:03:22 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 090/196] Remove BIP9 activation logic (#167)

We perform upgrades by doing scheduled hardforks every 6 months, so we don't need this code anymore. Also, we will remove nVersion from the block header later.
